  "card": "Reorders node shutdown so that fee estimator state is saved and unregistered after queued background validation callbacks are drained. Previously, pending block updates could be missed during shutdown, causing saved fee estimator state to lag behind the chain tip and leading the mempool fee estimator to discard the cached estimates file upon restart. The PR includes a unit test in node_init_tests that reproduces and verifies the callback drain ordering.",
